## Appendix C — Drill log 2023

Full evacuation drills in November 2023, measured from the alarm to the last person at the assembly point. The target is 4 minutes 30 seconds.

| Depot | Date | Time achieved | Result |
|---|---|---|---|
| GDY-1 | 14 November 2023 | 4 min 12 s | Pass |
| HAM-2 | 21 November 2023 | 5 min 03 s | Fail, repeat drill ordered |
| RTM-3 | 9 November 2023 | 3 min 47 s | Pass |
| GOT-4 | 16 November 2023 | 4 min 20 s | Pass |
| KLJ-5 | 28 November 2023 | 2 min 58 s | Pass |

The HAM-2 drill failed mainly because people at the far end of plug row H did not hear the siren over the reefer units; two additional sounder horns have been fitted on the bund. The ammonia scenario drill at GDY-1 was run on 15 November 2023 and the plant was isolated in 11 minutes 40 seconds.

